Phase 1 (Next week): Add the Dynamic UPI QR Code to the billing screen and basic Sales Analytics (Today's Sales Dashboard).
Phase 2: Build the WhatsApp Share Invoice feature and Bulk CSV Import.
Phase 3: Introduce Customer Ledgers (Credit Management) and Cloud Backup.
